--- SCREENS TO BUILD ---

AuthPage (first screen, no key stored):
  - Centered dark card with your logo + app name
  - Input: "Enter your API License Key" (text input, full width)
  - Button: "Activate" → calls POST /api/validate-key
  - On success: save key to electron-store, show DashboardPage
  - On fail: show red error message "Invalid or expired key"
  - Link: "Get access at [yoursite.com]" → opens browser

DashboardPage:
  - Header bar: "{email}" | "MONTHLY ACCESS" green badge | "Expires in Xd" | "Sign out" button
  - Center: "Choose Your Tool" heading
  - Two side-by-side cards:
    Left card:  Image generation icon + "AI Image Generation" + description + "Open" button
    Right card: Video generation icon + "AI Video Generation" + description + "Open" button
  - Footer: "YourBrand • v0.1.0-poc"
  - Sign out: clears stored key, returns to AuthPage

ImagePage:
  - Back button (← Dashboard) in top left
  - Main canvas area (dark background):
    - Empty state: "Start creating or drop media"
    - After generation: shows image (img tag with output_url)
    - Loading state: animated pulse skeleton
  - Bottom bar (sticky):
    [ + ] [ text input: "What do you want to create?" ] [ Model: Default x1 ] [ → ]
  - On submit:
    1. POST /api/generate/image → get job_id
    2. Show skeleton in canvas
    3. Poll GET /api/jobs/{job_id} every 3 seconds
    4. On completed: render image with download button
    5. On failed: show red error message

VideoPage:
  - Same layout as ImagePage
  - Bottom bar: prompt + duration selector (4s / 8s) + quality (Fast/HD) + send
  - After completion: HTML5 <video> tag with controls + download button
  - Note: video takes longer — show "Generating video... this may take 1-2 minutes"
    with animated progress indicator

